# Copy to .env.local only if you need to override the default.
#
# Where the presence server is. Vite bakes this in at BUILD time, so it is a
# property of the build, not of the running site.
#
#   unset, production  the page's own origin — how the deployed image serves
#                      it, and why nothing needs configuring there
#   unset, dev         http://localhost:5183, the server in ./server
#   a URL              a presence server deployed separately
#   off                no multiplayer at all
#
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://example.com
